        "speakerRole": "Founder, ClosetLift",
        "targetId": null,
        "tone": null,
        "text": "I'm seeking $150,000 in exchange for 12% of my company. Renters need more storage, but built-ins belong to the landlord and cheap wardrobes often fall apart during a move. We install adjustable floor-to-ceiling towers with broad protective pads and torque-limited compression posts—no drilling. Shelves, drawers and hanging rails click into the frame. We check ceiling suitability,,",
