      },
      {
        "id": "b04",
        "index": 3,
        "phase": "pitch",
        "kind": "pitch",
        "speakerId": "founder",
        "speakerName": "Sam",
        "speakerRole": "Founder, ClosetLift",
        "targetId": null,
        "tone": null,
        "text": "In our simulated first year, 600 households bought one $749 tower each, generating $449,400. Our $365 delivered-and-installed cost leaves $384 gross profit per order; we conservatively use that as LTV, against  So, Sharks: who's ready to invest $150,000 for 12% to fund a second installation crew, tower,?",
