        "speakerName": "Sam",
        "speakerRole": "Founder, ClosetLift",
        "targetId": "rex",
        "tone": null,
        "text": "Yes, tension furniture exists. We sell a complete fitted-storage service: measured, installed and later moved by us for $149 within our service area—not a box customers must figure out themselves.",
